<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT PHILADELPHIA WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT PHILADELPHIA WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Tuesday at the</p>
<p>$450,000 Advanta Championship women's tennis tournament</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>6-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Judith Wiesner (Austria) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Anna Kournikova (Russia) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat Gigi Fernandez (U.S.) 6-1 3-6 6-3</p>
</text>
